-- Style / combo text linked to the tuning numbers (Q 2026-10-18): {key} placeholders are filled from engine/tuning.ts
-- (champion_styles.params / champions.params) wherever the text is shown. Only the numbers changed; wording is as before.
-- Each update only fires on the text it was written against, so a text edited since is left alone.
update public.champion_styles set effect = $t$Start the game with {startDraw} cards on your Field. Acceleration: when you and the opponent both Strike (Dual Strike), your Energy refills and you draw {dualDraw} cards at the end of the turn. Overdrive: Strike with {minChain}+ cards and no S card → spend all your Energy, every card in the chain gets +{dmgPerEnergy} dmg per Energy (works while Silenced). Energy Surge: with full Energy at the start of the turn, Block or Charge spends it all. Block → Wraith Step: hits that get past your Block deal 1 dmg each. Charge → Shroud: no Charge break, and hits on you deal half.$t$
where champion_id = 'AS' and slot = 1 and effect = $t$Start the game with 3 cards on your Field. Acceleration: when you and the opponent both Strike (Dual Strike), your Energy refills and you draw 2 cards at the end of the turn. Overdrive: Strike with 3+ cards and no S card → spend all your Energy, every card in the chain gets +2 dmg per Energy (works while Silenced). Energy Surge: with full Energy at the start of the turn, Block or Charge spends it all. Block → Wraith Step: hits that get past your Block deal 1 dmg each. Charge → Shroud: no Charge break, and hits on you deal half.$t$;
update public.champion_styles set effect = $t$Every {every|ord} attack (counted across turns, blocked ones too) is a Critical: x{critMult} dmg, x{redCritMult} while the enemy's HP is red (below {redHpPct}% of Max HP). A blocked Critical still deals {blockedCritPct}% of its dmg. Energy Surge: with full Energy at the start of the turn, Block or Charge spends it all. Block → Wraith Step: hits that get past your Block deal 1 dmg each. Charge → Shroud: no Charge break, and hits on you deal half.$t$
where champion_id = 'AS' and slot = 2 and effect = $t$Every 4th attack (counted across turns, blocked ones too) is a Critical: x3 dmg, x4 while the enemy's HP is red (below 30% of Max HP). A blocked Critical still deals 50% of its dmg. Energy Surge: with full Energy at the start of the turn, Block or Charge spends it all. Block → Wraith Step: hits that get past your Block deal 1 dmg each. Charge → Shroud: no Charge break, and hits on you deal half.$t$;
update public.champion_styles set effect = $t$ถ้า HP ต่ำกว่า {hpPct}%: การ์ด {slots} ช่องแรกในสาย Strike +{bonusDmg} dmg$t$
where champion_id = 'BR' and slot = 1 and effect = $t$ถ้า HP ต่ำกว่า 50%: การ์ดช่อง 1 และ 2 ในสาย Strike +10 dmg$t$;
update public.champion_styles set effect = $t$Every Strike: +1 Momentum stack per card in the chain, before it hits (max {conquerorMax}). Each stack: +{dmgPerStack} dmg on every card you attack with. At {conquerorMax} stacks: Lifesteal (heal {omnivampPct}% of each hit), but a charge break makes enemy hits deal {chargeBreakTakenPct}% more. When stacks reach {conquerorMax}: Tenacity for {tenacityTurns} turns (charge break can't discard your slot 1 card). Each turn you Block: -{blockLoss} stack (Charge keeps them).$t$
where champion_id = 'BR' and slot = 2 and effect = $t$Every Strike: +1 Momentum stack per card in the chain, before it hits (max 6). Each stack: +1 dmg on every card you attack with. At 6 stacks: Lifesteal (heal 10% of each hit), but a charge break makes enemy hits deal 30% more. When stacks reach 6: Tenacity for 2 turns (charge break can't discard your slot 1 card). Each turn you Block: -1 stack (Charge keeps them).$t$;
update public.champion_styles set effect = $t$Touch of Flame: every Skill card you paid for that hits clean gives the opponent 1 Ignite (each stack burns {igniteFlat} HP + {ignitePctMaxHp}% Max HP every turn and cuts heals {healCutPerStack}%, max {healCutMax}%; {igniteTurns} turns, max {igniteMax} stacks). Molten Shield: when you Block with Mana, spend up to {moltenMaxMana} Mana for Shield {moltenShieldPerMana} per Mana this turn; each hit your Block stops gives the attacker 1 Ignite.$t$
where champion_id = 'MG' and slot = 1 and effect = $t$Touch of Flame: every Skill card you paid for that hits clean gives the opponent 1 Ignite (each stack burns 2 HP + 1% Max HP every turn and cuts heals 25%, max 50%; 3 turns, max 4 stacks). Molten Shield: when you Block with Mana, spend up to 3 Mana for Shield 5 per Mana this turn; each hit your Block stops gives the attacker 1 Ignite.$t$;
update public.champion_styles set effect = $t$Frost Armor: start the game with Shield {frostArmorShield}; every hit a Shield soaks gives the attacker 1 Chill. Deep Freeze: when you Strike with any Skill card in your chain, spend {deepFreezeMana} more Mana to give the opponent 1 Chill. Frozen Tomb (once a game): when you drop below {tombHpPct}% HP (the red bar), or would be knocked out (you stay on 1 HP), you are sealed in ice: Frost Armor's Shield {frostArmorShield} comes back and next turn you can only Block. At the end of that turn heal {tombHeal} + {tombHealPerMana} per Mana (all your Mana is spent). The turn after, {tombMeltPct}% of the Shield you have left turns into HP. Chill: each stack makes that side's hits deal {chillDmgCut}% less ({chillTurns} turns, max {chillMax}). At {chillMax} stacks the opponent is Frozen: Chill clears, Shatter takes {shatterPct}% of their Max HP and they can't Strike next turn. Absolute Zero (S + S + S all clean): the opponent is Frozen and can't Block next turn.$t$
where champion_id = 'MG' and slot = 2 and effect = $t$Frost Armor: start the game with Shield 40; every hit a Shield soaks gives the attacker 1 Chill. Deep Freeze: when you Strike with any Skill card in your chain, spend 1 more Mana to give the opponent 1 Chill. Frozen Tomb (once a game): when you drop below 30% HP (the red bar), or would be knocked out (you stay on 1 HP), you are sealed in ice: Frost Armor's Shield 40 comes back and next turn you can only Block. At the end of that turn heal 10 + 5 per Mana (all your Mana is spent). The turn after, half of the Shield you have left turns into HP. Chill: each stack makes that side's hits deal 10% less (3 turns, max 4). At 4 stacks the opponent is Frozen: Chill clears, Shatter takes 15% of their Max HP and they can't Strike next turn. Absolute Zero (S + S + S all clean): the opponent is Frozen and can't Block next turn.$t$;
update public.champion_styles set effect = $t$เมื่อโดนโจมตี ถ้า HP อยู่หลอดแดง (< {hpPct}% Max HP) = ฮีล {healPctPerHit}% missing HP x จำนวนครั้งที่โดนโจมตี ใน Turn นั้น (Effect นี้ทำงานเฉพาะรอบแรกที่ HP เข้าหลอดแดงเท่านั้น ถ้า HP ฟื้นกลับมาหลอดเขียว ({hpPct}%+) Effect นี้จะไม่ทำงานอีกต่อไป ตลอดเกมนั้นๆ)$t$
where champion_id = 'TK' and slot = 1 and effect = $t$เมื่อโดนโจมตี ถ้า HP อยู่หลอดแดง (< 30% Max HP) = ฮีล 4% missing HP x จำนวนครั้งที่โดนโจมตี ใน Turn นั้น (Effect นี้ทำงานเฉพาะรอบแรกที่ HP เข้าหลอดแดงเท่านั้น ถ้า HP ฟื้นกลับมาหลอดเขียว (30%+) Effect นี้จะไม่ทำงานอีกต่อไป ตลอดเกมนั้นๆ)$t$;
update public.champion_styles set effect = $t$เริ่มเกมด้วย HP / Max HP เท่ากับ Lifeline ({hpStart} / {hpMax}) , ทุกครั้งที่โดนโจมตี จะ + Max HP = {perHitTaken} ต่อ Hits , + Max HP = {perHitBlocked} ต่อ block สำเร็จ , + Max HP = {perFacing} ต่อจำนวนการ์ดที่ประจันหน้ากัน
Max HP Cap = {maxHpCap}
Every {hpPerDmg} Max HP grown this way = +1 dmg on every card you strike with.$t$
where champion_id = 'TK' and slot = 2 and effect = $t$เริ่มเกมด้วย HP / Max HP เท่ากับ Lifeline (210 / 300) , ทุกครั้งที่โดนโจมตี จะ + Max HP = 1 ต่อ Hits , + Max HP = 2 ต่อ block สำเร็จ , + Max HP = 3 ต่อจำนวนการ์ดที่ประจันหน้ากัน
Max HP Cap = 500
Every 20 Max HP grown this way = +1 dmg on every card you strike with.$t$;
update public.champions set signature_combo = $t$P + K + S (any order, all clean): Mark of Assassin — the opponent is marked for the rest of the game. Every later Strike against them bursts for {markBurstPct}% of that chain's total dmg, however much got through Block or Shield. Doesn't stack.$t$
where id = 'AS' and signature_combo = $t$P + K + S (any order, all clean): Mark of Assassin — the opponent is marked for the rest of the game. Every later Strike against them bursts for 50% of that chain's total dmg, however much got through Block or Shield. Doesn't stack.$t$;
update public.champions set signature_combo = $t$S+S+S (ลำดับไหนก็ได้) clean ครบ 3 → ศัตรู Block ไม่ได้ {comboNoBlockTurns} เทิร์น$t$
where id = 'MG' and signature_combo = $t$S+S+S (ลำดับไหนก็ได้) clean ครบ 3 → ศัตรู Block ไม่ได้ 1 เทิร์น$t$;
